SUMMARY:Milkshake Factory - One Year of Sweet Success!
DESCRIPTION:Join us on August 24th from 12 PM to 6 PM for our one-year anni
 versary celebration! As a huge thank you for your amazing support\, we're 
 offering an incredible Buy One Get One Free deal on all shakes and sundaes
 !\n\nGet ready to groove with a DJ spinning tunes out front\, and put your
  skills to the test with fun competitions and chances to win awesome prize
 s! It's going to be a day packed with sweet treats\, great music\, and ple
 nty of fun for everyone. We can't wait to celebrate with you!\n\nMore Info
 rmation
