 n\nKick off the holiday season at the 21st Annual lighting of the American
  Tobacco Water Tower on December 3rd at 7 pm.\n\nCome early to shop\, dine
 \, and visit our community booths before the celebration begins. We’ll a
 lso have 2\,000 fiber-optic wands to distribute!  Pre-show entertainment 
