SUMMARY:ART by Yasmina Reza (RedBird Theater Company)
DESCRIPTION:RedBird brings its 2024 hit show to Live at Bay 7 for a LIMITED
  ENGAGEMENT!\n\nThe value of strange modern art and the strength of strang
 e modern friendships are challenged by the purchase of an all-white painti
 ng for an eye-popping sum. Marc condemns the decision\, Serge stands firm\
 , and Yvan is squeezed in the middle as allegiances are strained\, tempers
  flare\, and secrets are hilariously brought to light.\n\nFebruary 6\, 7:3
 0 pm-9 pm\nFebruary 7\, 7:30 pm-9 pm\n\nTickets: $15 - $80 (+ fees)\n\nMor
 e Information + Tickets
