URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/the-song-of-the-earth-the-chamber-or
 chestra-of-the-triangle/
SUMMARY:The Song of the Earth (The Chamber Orchestra of the Triangle)
DESCRIPTION:Enter a realm where beauty and mortality intertwine in The Song
  of the Earth\, a hauntingly intimate performance of Arnold Schoenberg and
  Rainer Riehn’s arrangement of Gustav Mahler’s Das Lied von der Erde. 
 Scored for a reduced ensemble yet retaining every ounce of Mahler’s emot
 ional depth\, this rarely heard transcription brings clarity and immediacy
  to a masterpiece that meditates on life\, loss\, and the eternal. With it
 s fusion of symphony and song\, East and West\, hope and despair\, The Son
 g of the Earth offers a deeply human experience that is at once fragile\, 
 powerful\, and timeless.\n\nFebruary 14\, 7:30 pm-9 pm\nFebruary 15\, 4 pm
 -5:30 pm\n\nTickets: $10-35 (+fees)\n\nMore Information + Tickets
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/01/ATC-Tab-Placeholder-Live-at-Bay-7-logo.png
CATEGORIES:Concert
LOCATION:Bay 7 @ American Tobacco\, 324 Blackwell Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27
 701\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=324 Blackwell Street\, Durh
 am\, NC\, 27701\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Bay 7 @ America
 n Tobacco:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
