SUMMARY:Live Music @ATC / Screamin' Bridge and Martin County Ramblers
DESCRIPTION:Come hear a double show this Saturday from two beloved North Ca
 rolina bands. From 3-5\, Screamin' Bridge will be playing their own flavor
  of bluegrass\, and then after a quick break\, the Martin County Ramblers 
 will take us into the night with their blend of rock\, country and jam mus
 ic. Both shows are free\, and we encourage all to buy something to eat and
  drink from one of our local restaurants. Setup will be near the ATC water
  tower\, so bring a lawn chair\, get comfortable and enjoy the tunes!\n\nW
 e'll update the summer music schedule here.
