SUMMARY:AUSL Block Party on Blackwell Street
DESCRIPTION:\nCome enjoy the pregame Barbie-themed Fan Fest to celebrate th
 e first year of AUSL! Starting at noon\, there will be live music\, vendor
 s\, and more outside of the stadium on Blackwell Street. Then head to the 
 Durham Bulls Athletic Park at 2pm for a Blaze x Barbie Game Day. The firs
 t 2\,000 fans in attendance will receive a Blaze x Barbie Game Day Rally T
 owel giveaway. Fan Fest is free to attend\, but the game requires tickets.
 \nLearn more about the AUSL series at the DBAP here.\n\n
