URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/pop-the-cap-anniversary-discussion-a
 nd-toast/
SUMMARY:Pop The Cap | Anniversary Discussion and Toast
DESCRIPTION:It's been 21 years since former North Carolina Governor Mike Ea
 sley signed HB 392 into law\, raising the state's Alcohol by Volume (ABV) 
 limit for beer from 6% to 15%. Fullsteam founder and owner Sean Lilly Wils
 on organized that movement\, allowing brewers across the state to offer a 
 much wider variety of products to beer drinkers. Come join him and others 
 at Fullsteam's new ATC location for a panel discussion about the legacy of
  this legislation and all things beer in the Old North State\, followed by
  beer and cake!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Pop-the-Cap-Party-Invite.png
CATEGORIES:Special Event
LOCATION:Fullsteam ATC\, 320 Blackwell Street\, Ste. 101\, Durham\, NC\, 27
 701\, United States
