SUMMARY:MLBX at the DBAP
DESCRIPTION:Back to the Bull City by popular demand\, this electric 3-on-3 
 baseball format built around power hitting and athletic catching returns t
 o Durham on Friday\, September 18! Don't miss out on seeing MLB legends in
 cluding Ben Zobrist team up with professional softball and baseball star
 s\, plus players from the University of North Carolina\, Duke\, NC State U
 niversity\, and East Carolina University in an epic clash at the DBAP.\n\n
