 light. But when an ambitious young record producer brings her a rare oppor
 tunity\, the elusive diva must finally reckon with her past.\nHailed as
  a "jaw-dropping\, soul-stirring must see" (The Washington Post)\, the To
 ny® and GRAMMY® Award-winning BUENA VISTA SOCIAL CLUB™ is a journe
 y through music and memory into the beating heart of Havana. A world-cla
 ss company brings the story of the iconic album to thrilling life in th
 is tale of big dreams\, second chances\, and music that needs no translat
 ion.\nThis show will be at DPAC for an extended run\, with additional mati
 nee performances Saturday and Sunday. Please note that showtimes vary - c
 lick here for more information and to purchase tickets.
