SUMMARY:Saturday October 10 | Good Moon Festival feat. MJ Lenderman @ATC
DESCRIPTION:American Tobacco is hosting a free concert on the lawn Saturday
  October 10 as part of the Good Moon Festival. The ATC show will feature A
 sheville\, North Carolina's own MJ Lenderman\, who has garnered attention 
 in recent years from a range of national media\, including the New York Ti
 mes\, Rolling Stone\, GQ and more. He's performed on a variety of late nig
 ht shows as well\, including The Late Show With Stephen Colbert\, The Toni
 ght Show With Jimmy Fallon\, and Austin City Limits. Lenderman will be per
 forming with local alt-country band Woke County Speedway.\n\nSpecific show
 time will be announced closer to the date. Stay tuned at goodmoonnc.com
