URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/dan-and-phil-hard-launch-world-tour/
SUMMARY:Dan and Phil | Hard Launch World Tour
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nDAN AND PHIL are all time legends of the internet. Since 
 posting their first YouTube video together from a bedroom in 2009\, they h
 ave conquered the globe. Racking up BILLIONS of views\, millions of follow
 ers and breaking ground in every field - from International #1 Bestselling
  books\, to mind blowing theatrical stage shows on sold out world tours\, 
 and award winning TV and radio broadcasting.\n\nMost recently\, Dan and Ph
 il brought social media to a standstill again when they confirmed their lo
 ng-rumoured relationship in the acclaimed feature-length video that beca
 me their now-iconic 'Hard Launch'\, before launching their chart-topping H
 ard Launch podcast - an unfiltered new space where they can finally be the
 ir truest\, hilarious selves. Having grown up with (or some would say rais
 ed) an entire generation online\, they're turning the volume up when the w
 orld needs it most: proud\, unapologetic and more unfiltered than ever - c
 oming live to a stage near you.\n\nGet your tickets here.\n\n\n\nRead Less
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Dan-and-Phil.png
CATEGORIES:Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. 'Bill' Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
