URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/elmos-got-the-moves/
SUMMARY:Elmo's Got The Moves
DESCRIPTION:Make unforgettable memories with your little ones at Elmo’s G
 ot the Moves—the all-new Sesame Street Live show coming to your neighbor
 hood!\n\nThis exciting show will have kids and parents alike out of their 
 seats and moving and dancing along with Elmo and his Sesame Street friends
  as they dance\, stretch\, and play along to fan-favorite songs\, includin
 g “Sunny Days\,” “Elmo’s Got the Moves\,” and “Letter of the D
 ay.”\n\nFamilies will discover fun and playful ways to move—from yoga 
 and jumping rope to cartwheeling and silly dance moves— all in a welcomi
 ng environment that brings the magic of Sesame Street from the screen to t
 he stage.  More than just a show\, Elmo’s Got the Moves is a shared mom
 ent of laughter and learning - an experience you and your child will treas
 ure long after the final song.\n\nGet your tickets here!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Elmo-Got-the-Moves.png
CATEGORIES:Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. 'Bill' Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
