SUMMARY:Clint Black & Midland | US Limited Tour
DESCRIPTION:Country music legend Clint Black is teaming up with GRAMMY-nomi
 nated retro nuevo trio Midland for a special limited-run tour\, bringing t
 ogether two celebrated acts for just eight exclusive performances. Fans ca
 n expect unforgettable nights filled with timeless hits\, modern country f
 avorites\, and a one-of-a-kind concert experience.\n\nThe tour marks a rar
 e collaboration between one of country music’s most iconic voices and on
 e of today’s most dynamic bands\, bringing together two eras of country 
 music for an unforgettable night of hits and high-energy performances. Th
 e eight-show run will offer audiences a rare opportunity to see both acts 
 share the stage for an unforgettable evening of music and storytelling.\n\
 nGet your tickets here.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/ClintBlack-Midland.png
