 ur/
SUMMARY:Little Big Town | For The Art Of It Tour
DESCRIPTION:GRAMMY\, ACM\, CMA\, AMA\, and Emmy Award-winning group\, Littl
 e Big Town – consisting of members Karen Fairchild\, Phillip Sweet\, Kim
 berly Schlapman\, and Jimi Westbrook – burst onto the music scene 25 yea
 rs ago with smash hits “Boondocks\,” “Bring It On Home\,” “Good 
 As Gone” and the GRAMMY-nominated “Little White Church.”\n\nCome hea
 r them perform these and more hits live at the DPAC. Get your tickets here
 .
