URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/death-becomes-her-broadway-at-dpac-2
 026-11-10/
SUMMARY:Death Becomes Her | Broadway at DPAC
DESCRIPTION:Now a warning! You may not be ready for the unbelievable amoun
 t of comedy\, glamour\, and magic onstage. DEATH BECOMES HER is a “wil
 dly entertaining\, perfect musical comedy. It grabs the audience by the ju
 gular and doesn’t let go” (Deadline). With direction and choreography 
 by Tony winner Christopher Gattelli\, DEATH BECOMES HER is “a laugh-fi
 lled\, tuneful musical to die for” (Variety) and “a cheek-aching laug
 hter roller coaster — the most fun night out on Broadway!” (The Daily 
 Beast). See it now\, and laugh for eternity.\n\nCatch it during its six-da
 y run at DPAC\, including additional matinee performances on Saturday and 
