SUMMARY:FestiBull of Lights
DESCRIPTION:FestiBull of Lights transforms the Durham Bulls Athletic Park i
 nto a dazzling winter wonderland! Stroll through thousands of twinkling li
 ghts synchronized to festive music\, creating a magical holiday experience
  for all ages. Meet Santa\, hop aboard the NC by Train Holiday Express\, c
 reate seasonal crafts\, roast s’mores\, savor festive food and drinks\, 
 and enjoy even more holiday fun — all surrounded by a breathtaking displ
 ay of lights!\n\nGet your tickets here!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Fesitbull-of-Lights.jpeg
