 08/
SUMMARY:The Bodyguard | Broadway @DPAC
DESCRIPTION:Based on the 1992 film starring Whitney Houston and Kevin Costn
 er\, THE BODYGUARD is a thrilling\, romantic musical that combines high
 -stakes suspense with unforgettable music. Former Secret Service agent tur
 ned bodyguard\, Frank Farmer\, is hired to protect superstar Rachel Marro
 n from an unknown stalker. Both expect to be in charge of their situation
  - what they don’t expect is to fall in love.\n\nA “BRILLIANT” (The 
 Times)\, breathtakingly romantic thriller\, THE BODYGUARD features a who
 le host of unforgettable classics including “Queen of the Night\,” 
 “So Emotional\,” “I Will Always Love You\,” “I Wanna Dance with
  Somebody\,” "Saving All My Love\," and "One Moment in Time"\, alongside
  thrilling plot twists and emotional drama. THE BODYGUARD is an electri
 fying combination of romance\, suspense and chart-topping music that will
  captivate audiences from start to finish.\n\nCatch a performance during t
 his six-day stay at DPAC. Note that showtimes vary. Get your tickets here.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Bodyguard.png
CATEGORIES:Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. 'Bill' Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
