URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/straight-no-chaser-making-spirits-br
 ight-tour/
SUMMARY:Straight No Chaser | Making Spirits Bright Tour
DESCRIPTION:Look up “holiday music” in the dictionary\, and it’s like
 ly that there is a photo of the nine-person a cappella group Straight No C
 haser instead of a standard definition. For more than two decades\, the gr
 oup has provided the soundtrack of the season\, bringing millions of fans 
 to their feet while putting them in the holiday spirit. Year after year\, 
 fans anxiously await the moment they can officially hit play on Straight N
 o Chaser favorites.\n\nAnd this year is no different.\n\nStraight No Chase
 r is back on tour\, serving up an all-you-can-eat buffet of holiday music 
 (with none of the calories) as they cross the U.S. from October through De
 cember. Get your tickets here!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Straight-no-Chaser.png
CATEGORIES:Concert,Holiday,Live Music,Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. 'Bill' Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
